 YesOrNoWithLongCaption;myGuiParms;parms
⍝ Presents a "Yes" and a "No" button together with a long message.
 myGuiParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 myGuiParms.caption←'My application'
 parms←##.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo
 parms.addToCaption←'This is a very long caption'
 ⎕←parms myGuiParms ##.APLGUI.Dialogs.YesOrNo'Are you sure?'
